{"version":1,"content":"<p>早上10時50分，警方接報指上水清曉路18號一個地盤對開，一名男工人工作期間，懷疑失平衡跌倒，被鋼筋插傷。</p><p>鋼筋插入事主下顎，消防將他救起並連同鋼筋一併送威爾斯親王醫院搶救，警方及勞工處正調查事件原因。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:45:11.896350+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T04:33:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:38:52.645239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T09:38:52.645239+00:00","content_hash":"493c3a3cc472c44fd715c648ec8e17cf766e50d5a3b4a8cdd5260cdcf52c3a8f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}